      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/87869e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-22T16:04:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This's more a question looking for clarification re: the 'don't post custom stuff in the forum' rule than anything else...</p><p>Is there a similar rule regarding showing custom content to the &gt;G guys at a con, so I'd have to keep anything I came up with on my own limited to other players and any future villain contests that happen?</p>",
